  dialogs:
  - Speaker: Me
    Speaches:
    - "I think I\u2019ve encountered just about every possible creature anomaly by
      now, haven\u2019t I?"
    SpriteIdxes: 
  - Speaker: 
    Speaches:
    - "Who knows? But it seems they\u2019ve taken quite a liking to you."
    SpriteIdxes: 00000000
  - Speaker: Me
    Speaches:
    - "Really? Aside from feeling a little exhausted from working night shifts, I
      think I\u2019m doing pretty well! Just two more days until I\u2019m officially
      hired. I\u2019m kind of excited!"
    SpriteIdxes: 
  - Speaker: 
    Speaches:
    - "I\u2019m excited for you, too! You\u2019re one of the most promising applicants
      I\u2019ve ever met. You have to pass, alright? Otherwise\u2026 I might find
      myself missing you from time to time."
    SpriteIdxes: 00000000
  - Speaker: Me
    Speaches:
    - "Aww! You\u2019re so nice!"
    SpriteIdxes: 
  - Speaker: 
    Speaches:
    - "(The receptionist\u2019s smile slowly fades.) "
    - "\u2026"
    - "Thank you. You\u2019re quite nice yourself."
    SpriteIdxes: 000000000000000000000000
